    {
     "start": 26,
     "end": 38,
     "type": "PHONE"
    }
   ],
   "not_expected": [
    {
     "start": 58,
     "end": 66,
     "type": "PHONE"
    }
   ],
   "why": "a JSON key that names a phone makes its value a phone; a build number stays text (DETECTION-CONTRACT-PROPOSAL.md, the example)"
  },
  {
